WEBVTT

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:10.140
We came to America to meet Pegasus, but Mai Kujaku was waiting for us.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:15.630
She already defeated Pegasus, and she's going to take my and Yugi's souls?

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.140
What happened to you, Mai?

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.840
That's The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:26.890
Stop it!  I don't want to battle you like this!

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:47.770
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:54.910
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.690 --> 00:01:01.570
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.560
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:14.930
With our memories fading

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:22.010
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:28.910
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:36.160
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:54.890 --> 00:02:00.900
Mai Who Fell Into Darkness

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:11.550
Damn!  Is Mai serious?

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:14.110
Oh no!  Whoever loses...

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:16.050
Loses their soul.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.220
Stop this, Mai!

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:23.220
Why do you and Jonouchi have to fight for your souls?

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:28.080
My other self, stop them!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:31.360
Right.  If I can get rid of that seal...

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:34.130
Don't bother, Yugi.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:36.480
Don't waste your time.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:40.700
A Millennium Item isn't strong enough to destroy the seal.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:44.910
Just watch them duel.

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:45.840
Damn!

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:48.570
Don't worry, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:52.120
I'll duel you after this one.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:54.850
You won't get a chance, Rafael!

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:57.310
I'll defeat Yugi too!

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.790
Don't interfere.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:00.060
Mai!

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:00.980
Mai?

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.730
Don't be selfish, Mai Kujaku.

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:06.730
Did you forget Dartz's orders?

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.500
It's fine, Rafael.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.720
Let her do what she wants.

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:15.000
As long as she captures their souls.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:15.680
Valon.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:20.630
Let's see how Mai duels.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:23.970
We can take over later if we need to.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.360
What's wrong, Jonouchi?

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:28.490
It's your turn.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:32.390
I said I'm not accepting this duel!

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:33.920
You're bailing?

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:39.830
A real duelist wouldn't turn down a challenge!

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:42.680
But this isn't a normal duel!

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:46.300
You or me - whoever loses will lose their soul!

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.240
So what?

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:50.400
Mai?

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.010
A duel is always a serious fight!

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:57.720
You risk your own existence.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:00.720
That's how I've always fought.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:03.180
It's not just a game!

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:09.160
If you're going to run, then I'm a fool for overestimating you!

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:13.100
So we really have to fight, Mai?

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:15.330
Stop making me repeat myself!

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.540
Jonouchi, you're...

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:21.710
Don't do this!

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.040
My turn!   I draw!

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:32.820
I summon Alligator's Sword in defense position!

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.190
I end my turn!

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:38.260
Dammit.  How should I duel?

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.000
My turn!  I draw!

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.990
You still look confused.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:45.520
If you are, you'll never defeat me!

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:48.460
I summon Harpie Lady in attack position!

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:53.950
The Seal of Orichalcos gives her 500 attack points!

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:58.010
Harpie Lady attacks Alligator's Sword!

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:04.560
And the other Harpie Lady attacks you directly!

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.240
Jonouchi!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.620
I can't watch!

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:13.580
He won't risk their lives in a duel!

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:17.610
Why does Mai want to play this duel?

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:20.540
Has she really joined Doma?

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:21.960
I don't know.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:26.490
What happened to her after Battle City when we parted ways?

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:28.770
Yugi!

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:32.510
Next time we meet, I won't lose!

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:33.770
Right.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:45.200
But Mai is seriously trying to defeat Jonouchi.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.260
No way...

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:47.730
Jonouchi!

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:51.450
And other than having to face Mai...

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.850
...the odds are against Jonouchi.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:57.600
Due to The Seal of Orichalcos's effect...

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:03.040
...Mai's monsters gain 500 attack points the moment they're summoned.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.350
Eye of Timaeus.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:08.780
This card would give him a chance, but...

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:12.240
That's Eye of Timaeus.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:18.580
But no matter what power that card has, he can't interfere in this duel!

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:21.460
Wake up yet?

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.760
If you want to defeat me, fight with all your might!

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:29.060
I set a card and end my turn!

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.020
Mai...

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.730
It was burning until recently.

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:41.680
Fire at a gas station?  How dangerous!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.940
What are you doing?  Drive safely!

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:55.430
I have a bad feeling.  I'm speeding up - hold on tight!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.660
No good, big brother.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:13.270
I can't contact Industrial Illusions.

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:15.600
As expected.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.760
Big brother?

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:21.320
Amelda called me out by pretending to be Pegasus.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:25.980
So Pegasus must have fallen into enemy hands.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:29.930
Then isn't it dangerous to go to Industrial Illusions?

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:33.860
I'm not afraid of danger.  Besides...

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:38.190
It's the key to victory!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.300
I bet it all on this card!

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.870
Go!  Fang of Critias!

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.940
What's that card?

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:50.700
Its effect fuses it with a trap card to summon a Fusion Monster!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.680
An unknown card...

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.360
How did I know its effect?

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:00.810
I don't like how it appeared, like in the occult.

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:03.820
But this card's power is real.

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:04.930
So it's fine.

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:06.800
Big brother?

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.050
Let's hurry, Mokuba.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:11.310
We'll catch them before they escape.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:28.780
What happened to Mai?

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:33.030
She's not the same Mai who's trying to become a true duelist.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:36.880
There's definitely a reason why.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:42.400
That punk!

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:45.890
Are they deceiving her?

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:47.340
They must be!

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:50.340
Or she wouldn't be doing this!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:53.300
Your turn!  Hurry up.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.780
How can I bring her to her senses?

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:58.220
My turn.  I draw!

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.550
Yeah!  This'll work!

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:04.160
I summon Rocket Warrior in defense position!

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:11.190
And I set a card and end my turn!

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:16.550
What, Jonouchi?  Only playing defense?

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:18.730
Mai, finish him quick!

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:21.390
Be quiet, Valon!

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:23.170
This is my duel!

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.110
Ooh.  Scary.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.720
Just wait, Mai.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.560
I'll save you.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:37.990
I must find a way to bring her to her senses...

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:40.420
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:44.430
Harpie Ladies, shred your foes with your claws!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.750
Harpie Lady attacks!

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:54.840
The other Harpie Lady attacks you directly!

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:56.590
Oh no!

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:57.840
Jonouchi!

00:09:57.840 --> 00:09:59.040
Jonouchi!

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:03.170
I flip over my set card!  Scapegoat!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:07.610
Good!  This'll buy time from her attacks.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.610
Not good enough, Jonouchi!

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.790
I flip over my set card!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.720
Nightmare Tri-Mirror!

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:14.660
What?

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:18.240
Nightmare Tri-Mirror?

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:24.030
For every non-Normal Summoned monster you have...

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:28.970
...I can Special Summon a Copy Token of my monster.

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:29.900
What?

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:32.020
That means...

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:35.040
There are four Scapegoats.

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:40.530
So Mai can summon four Harpie Lady Copy Tokens!

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:46.310
That's cheating!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:48.930
She can bring out that many monsters?

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:55.930
Due to The Seal of Orichalcos, Mai can summon up to ten monsters.

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:58.400
Damn!  That's not fair!

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:06.380
Copy Tokens can't attack on my turn.

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:11.080
But you can't defeat me unless you destroy them!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:16.350
I set a card and end my turn!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:33.600
Jonouchi, how will you escape this situation?

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:37.500
Or will you lose without doing anything?

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:38.240
Mai...

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:43.640
Show me the skills you used to win in Battle City!

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:46.840
What should he do?

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:50.260
Jonouchi is on the ropes!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:57.080
My other self, we've never seen Nightmare Tri-Mirror before.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:02.800
Yeah.  It must be a special card that can only be used inside The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:04.730
Then that one too?

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:08.830
Jonouchi is in a worse situation.

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:13.370
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.340
Nice!  This'll work!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:20.350
I summon Panther Warrior in attack position!

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:23.620
I'll make you come to your senses, Mai!

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:26.030
I tribute Scapegoat!

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:28.090
Panther Warrior attacks!

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:33.640
I flip over my set card!

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.740
Harpie Lady Sparrow Formation!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:46.370
I can only activate this trap card when I have at least two Harpie Ladies!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:50.090
The flaming wings block and negate all attacks!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.520
It stopped Panther Warrior's attack!

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:55.690
Oh no!

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:58.900
It's a perfect tactic built around Harpie Lady.

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:02.890
Mai's deck is much stronger than in Battle City!

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:08.420
Damn!  This attack isn't good enough to wake Mai up!

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:11.260
How can I make her come to her senses?

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.250
Come to my senses?

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:15.040
I'm not insane!

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:19.610
They're not deceiving or controlling me.

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:23.780
I chose to fight you.

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:25.720
Say what?

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:27.120
She must be joking!

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:34.280
You'll never understand because you always keep moving forward.

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:54.230
Go!  Tri-Horned Dragon!

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:56.400
Attack Harpie Lady!

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.240
I flip over my set card!

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:00.270
Mirror Wall!

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:03.150
It cuts your monster's attack points in half!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:06.960
Damn!  I flip over my set card!

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:09.170
The Quick-Play Spell, Rush Recklessly!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:12.630
Tri-Horned Dragon's attack points rise to 2125!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.560
I win!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.860
I flip over my set card!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:18.500
Fairy's Hand Mirror!

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:19.940
No way!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:24.870
This card transfers your spell card's effect to another monster.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:26.770
To Harpie Lady!

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:28.310
Go, Harpie Lady!

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:33.200
I lost.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:38.680
It's over!  The winner is Mai Kujaku!

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:47.490
After Battle City, I won duel tournaments worldwide so I could catch up to you.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:52.600
But even when I won, I didn't feel better.  Instead...

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:55.970
Too bad.  You almost won.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:15:00.510
She did finish Top 8 in Battle City.

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:02.300
That's true.

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:07.610
Since she's that tough, I can't imagine how strong Yugi Muto is.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:13.050
And Katsuya Jonouchi is incredible to make Top 4 without a God Card!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:16.060
Yeah!  I wish I could duel them!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:18.520
We'll be no match for them.

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:19.720
That's true.

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:21.100
Yeah.

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:52.120
Since you lost this Shadow Game, the darkness will devour your soul.

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.400
Slowly.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:57.920
No!

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.340
Let me out!  Please!

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:03.670
Let me out!  Save me!

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:05.610
No!

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:10.540
Save me!  Save me, Jonouchi-

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:27.840
Fear of defeat and hunger for victory ruled my heart.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.200
Go, Harpie Lady!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.130
Attack him directly!

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:45.900
No.

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:03.100
No.  My dueling must be more...

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.870
You won, but you don't look happy.

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:11.370
Who are you?

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:14.310
Duel me.

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:17.310
Scared?

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:20.120
No I'm not!

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.870
Then let's do it.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.930
I win.

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:36.300
You're afraid of losing, right?

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.050
Stop it!

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:41.730
Save me.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:46.090
No!

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:50.550
Help!  Help me, Jonouchi!

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:56.550
I don't want to lose!  Save me, Jonouchi!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.920
He won't save you.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:04.910
As long as you lack self-confidence and depend on others...

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.190
...you can't win.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:12.780
But I know that you're actually a strong woman.

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:13.600
Right?

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:16.060
I don't want to lose.

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:17.540
Against anyone!

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.540
Then come with us.

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:23.240
We'll give you what you really want.

00:18:29.070 --> 00:18:33.900
I want what you got in Battle City!

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:37.590
The power to never lose as a duelist!

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:44.550
I didn't know you were in such pain, Mai.

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:47.440
I want to catch up to you!

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:49.660
I want to defeat you!

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:52.600
It's the only way!

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:56.950
From my hand, I activate the spell card, Harpie Lady Phoenix Formation!

00:18:56.950 --> 00:19:02.350
This card destroys your monster for every Harpie Lady on my field!

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:06.120
What?  She has six Harpie Ladies!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:10.120
That's more monsters than Jonouchi has!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.290
Jonouchi!

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:18.590
And you lose life points equal to your destroyed monsters' total attack points!

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:21.380
Go, Harpie Ladies!

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:24.980
Flap your wings and destroy all his monsters!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:40.920
You survived because Scapegoats have 0 attack points, Jonouchi.

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:43.180
I end my turn.

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:46.200
This is really bad.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.130
Life points are 4000 vs 200!

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:54.570
And Mai has six monsters while Jonouchi has nothing to defend with!

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:58.400
If nothing changes, Jonouchi will lose next turn.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:00.570
Can't he do anything, Yugi?

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:04.510
Mai has become much stronger since Battle City.

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:09.950
And she's fighting with everything she has as a duelist!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:13.890
Her passion is overwhelming Jonouchi.

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:19.330
This is wrong!  They're friends!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:21.930
Hang in there, Jonouchi!

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:24.260
And find a way!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:26.040
It's over.

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:28.120
How disappointing.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.440
I expected more because Mai was so obsessed with him.

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:36.140
But we can sacrifice his soul for our god.

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:40.620
Mai, I really can't save you?

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:44.670
Isn't there anything I can do for you?

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:49.550
No matter what you think, you're still our friend.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:54.600
If nothing changes, I can't win.

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:58.040
If sacrificing my life will save you...

00:20:58.620 --> 00:20:59.980
...that's fine.

00:21:00.810 --> 00:21:02.880
No, Jonouchi!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.790
Never do that!

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:12.730
You must never do that against a duelist who's giving her all!

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:14.680
Yugi.

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:20.260
Even if you save her life, that won't save her!

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:26.410
What you're planning to do will dishonor her soul as a duelist!

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:33.260
Thanks for stopping me, Yugi.

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:35.500
What I must do...

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:39.440
What I can do to actually save Mai...

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:42.120
My turn!  I draw!

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:47.360
Mai!  I'll respond to your wishes with this card!

00:21:56.770 --> 00:22:05.680
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:14.020
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:25.180
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:25.800 --> 00:22:34.700
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:43.730
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:49.240
I'll live feeling them

00:22:49.850 --> 00:22:54.420
For me to be me

00:22:54.420 --> 00:23:02.880
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:03.560 --> 00:23:08.520
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:18.180
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:27.820
Mai's maddening scream...

00:23:27.820 --> 00:23:31.970
None of us realized she was in such pain.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:37.340
But it's still wrong to duel Jonouchi for your souls!

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:41.240
Jonouchi!  You're seriously going to duel Mai?

00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:46.200
Yugi!  Is there a way to save them both?

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:49.700
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Resurrect!  The Third Dragon

00:23:49.700 --> 00:23:51.290
Duel, standby!
